ess","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Definition check first:** confirm tracking error is the annualized standard deviation of daily *NAV* total-return differences against the correct index variant (gross/net). Confirm that dates and holidays align, and that market price was not used by mistake.\n\n**Portfolio causes**\n- Sampling or optimization mismatch versus full replication.\n- Cash drag from uninvested dividends or flows, or futures/equitization basis.\n- Rebalance and index-change timing: early or late trades, missed adds or deletes.\n- Corporate-action handling, such as spin-offs, mergers and rights.\n- Securities-lending recalls.\n\n**Pricing causes**\n- Fund versus index pricing sources and close times.\n- Fair-value or stale-price adjustments.\n- Dividend ex-date accrual and reinvestment assumptions.\n- Halted or illiquid names.\n\n**Operating causes**\n- Trade, allocation or settlement errors.\n- Large creation/redemption flows executed away from the close.\n- Fee or expense accrual misstatements.\n- Index-data or holdings-file errors.\n- Reconciliation breaks.\n\nSeparate recurring drivers from one-off outlier days. Attribute each by daily return decomposition.","ttft_ms":3884,"type":"result","duration_ms":8235,"uuid":"6aeceac8-b969-4591-9fed-8b99cd1a0eac","ttft_stream_ms":1185,"time_to_request_ms":70,"first_content_frame_ms":1186,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
